  "title": "xml: Change cleanup routine to shutdown routine",
  "description": "\"init\" and \"cleanup\" routines are called when a capture file or\npreferences change. \"shutdown\" routines are called once right before\nthe epan scope is destroyed. The encoding pattern GRegex is fixed\nand doesn't depend on the preferences or the file, so it should be\ncreated once on registration and use a shutdown routine.",
